  "description": "The S‑Electro 85 is built for riders who want a smooth, reliable e‑MTB that’s just as comfortable on daily routes as it is for weekend adventures. The efficient Shimano EP600 mid‑drive motor delivers natural assistance for climbs and longer rides, paired with a Shimano 630 Wh battery for dependable range. A 100 mm AIR suspension fork adds comfort and control on rougher paths, while the Shimano CUES 10‑speed drivetrain and hydraulic disc brakes keep shifting crisp and braking predictable in all conditions. Rolling on 29\" wheels with tubeless‑ready rims, the S‑Electro 85 blends stability, agility, and everyday practicality—your ready‑to‑ride electric hardtail for commuting, fitness, and weekend adventure.",
